憶を失っており、自分がどこから来た何者なのか分からない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"地元の大学の援助を受け、白波学園に編入される。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちょっと女っぽい名前にコンプレックスを持っている。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7481","sourceWorkId":"11923","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"海浜公園に漂着した少年で、本作の主人公。記憶を失っており、自分がどこから来た何者なのか分からない。地元の大学の援助を受け、白波学園に編入される。ちょっと女っぼい名前にコンプレックスを持っている。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"163950"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9d/9d8914009d5a7f89cab5d1bc42bca8f7a4c8f17e95eb26df237f97f53eb983f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8aac03707a1afac7c920a2bf4b4a57e9b5e98c7d200cf4c04babbd865758af7e.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c3093","characterName":"あむちゃん","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"12223","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"4529"}],"egsCharacterIds":["7472"],"vndbCharacterId":"c3093"},"originalCharacterName":"あむちゃん","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"egs","value":"12/27"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"86"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"57"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Ayumu is Nagisa’s next-door neighbor at Himawari Heights and they have been together since they were young. She is quite popular at school, but she has problems being with guys other than Nagisa and Masaki. Really close friends with Nene, who calls her Amu-chan. Likes sunflowers and ecchi books (to know what guys like). She can’t wake up by herself, so Nagisa drops by every morning to wake her up. Fails at doing housework in general. She often says ‘hikuwa~’."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Micchi's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c3093"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が下宿しているアパート『ヒマワリハイツ』のお隣さん。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"人目を惹く容姿に、人当たりの良い性格で学内での人気はかなり高い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事情から異性が苦手で、主人公や親友の月島以外をひどく警戒していた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"趣味は花嫁修業とエッチな本。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7472","sourceWorkId":"11923","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公租住的『向日葵公寓』的邻居。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"有着引人注目的容貌、待人友善的性格，因此在学园内人气相当高。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"由于某件事而不善于与异性相处，并警惕着主人公。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兴趣是花嫁修业和H本。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"12223"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"89 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7472","sourceWorkId":"11923","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7472","sourceWorkId":"11923","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7472","sourceWorkId":"11923","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"57 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"7472","sourceWorkId":"11923","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7c01e7054f53615c72d9fc381a86fbe46d24b0b0c4083775fe13499a36f47144.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c7/c79d9ba948c5b62fb64a633a10a50d0a7221a95867750acef293532659edc3c7.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"結下みちる","creatorId":"vndb:s794","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s794","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s794","name":"結下 みちる","roleCode":"